            <chunk name="Object" index="2">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">cbb9837c-7431-445d-82eb-2fd44e2581a0</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">BLENDER DMX EXPORT — v1.0.0</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Export a Rhino 8 scene to a DMX package
(CSV + JSON + venue.glb) for BlenderDMX.
Requires Rhino &gt;= 8.3.

── INPUTS ──────────────────────────────
folder           output folder
run              ▶ write CSV + JSON + GLB
layer_root       fixtures prefix (LIGHTS)
start_address    first DMX address (1)
dmx_universe     DMX universe (1)
export_venue     write venue.glb

── OUTPUTS ─────────────────────────────
lines   CSV preview (header + rows)
count   number of fixtures
log     diagnostics

── RHINO SCENE ─────────────────────────
Fixtures : Block Instances on sub-layers
           of LIGHTS:: (ex LIGHTS::B200-INT).
           User attributes per instance:
             id    = BI-01
             gdtf  = Manuf@Name@Rev.gdtf
             mode  = 7 Channels
Venue    : any geometry on VENUE or VENUE::*.

── WORKFLOW ────────────────────────────
1. Set `folder`, click `run` once:
     dmx_overview.csv   (human-readable)
     dmx_overview.json  (pivot for import)
     venue.glb          (if toggled)
2. In Blender:
     run blender/import_to_blenderdmx.py
     → fixtures placed, named, addressed,
       oriented via Target.

── NOTES ───────────────────────────────
Beam direction    = local +Z (FORWARD_LOCAL)
DMX address order = layer order then id alpha
Venue GLB         = -90° X pre-rotation
                    (glTF Y-up compensation)
CHANNEL_MAP       = hardcoded (POC)</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="5">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>46</X>
                          <Y>276</Y>
                          <W>405</W>
                          <H>531</H>
                        </item>
